<title>HONG KONG: Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on HSBC. [CORRECTED 06:30 GMT 18/10]</title>
<headline>Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on HSBC. [CORRECTED 06:30 GMT 18/10]</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd said on Thursday it has launched up to 80 million American-style put (corrects from &quot;call&quot;) warrants on shares of HSBC Holdings Plc.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$152.50    PREMIUM	 12 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$1.83	GEARING	 8.33X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  17.SEP.97    PAYDATE	 to be determined</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    MIN EXER LOT  4,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$152.50</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6369</p>
</text>
